.
.  Generate sample output for chi-square PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na chspdf.jpg
device 2 gd jpeg
device 2 picture points 100 75
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (3 df)
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT CHSPDF(X,3) FOR X = 0 0.01 5
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv chspdf.jpg ../gif100/chspdf.jpg
.
quit
